BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Collisions between vessels</h1>
On the SLF runway a delta-glider taxis into a parked Shuttle-A; in orbit
a ShuttlePB pushes into another one. Neither may pass through the other.
END_HYPERDESC

